        <mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;i&gt;One scale for both panels. Recording both accruals adds 383,044.82 of expense and removes 365,921.19, so 2026 income moves only 17,123.63. The liability at the year-end carries the whole 383,044.82: 365,921.19 of it falls on opening retained earnings and 17,123.63 on 2026 income. Manufacturing&#x27;s part of each amount is taken as a cost of the period.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="362" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
